        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of the companies against which we may compete have significantly greater financial resources and expertise in research and development, manufacturing, non-clinical testing, conducting clinical trials, obtaining regulatory approvals and marketing approved products than we do.",
