        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "More broadly, for palazestrant, OP-3136, and any future product candidates we may develop, we intend to identify and qualify additional manufacturers to provide the active pharmaceutical ingredient and fill-and-finish services prior to seeking regulatory approval.",
